@ Index:   Problem 3, penny a second, solves FV
@ Author:  Jaco Mostert, fm Duncan Murray's problem set
@ One penny a second for a year (60^2 x 24 x 365 periods) at 10%.
@ Solves FV.
LBL ‘P3’
  60
  𝑥²
  24
  ×
  365
  ×
  STO ‘NPPER’
  STO ‘PPER/a’
  STO ‘CPER/a’
  10
  STO ‘I%/a’
  0
  STO ‘PV’
  -0.01
  STO ‘PMT’
  ENDP
  FV
  END
